\staff {score tabs}
\tuning (E4 B3 G3 D3 A2 E2)
\ts (4 4)
\ro :1 0.5 | \ae 1 \rc 2 2.5 | \ae 2 \jump fine 3.5 | 5.5 | \jump daCapoAlFine 7.5 |
